                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "On paper this is exactly the kind of game I enjoy so I was really disappointed when I finally got it. The controls don't feel responsive enough and the gameplay is heavily reliant on physics interactions which feel really difficult to predict so some sections end up feeling really frustrating, random and unfair. I got past the first boss after multiple attempts not because I mastered it, but just because I finally got lucky and the physics didn't screw me over on that particular attempt. That was when I gave up because I realised I just wasn't having fun playing the game.",
